{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology","id":1198059,"title":"Essence-based Technology","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-21T11:58:03-07:00","id":1198059,"title":"Essence-based Technology","content":"So, this is mostly a thought exercise, but has anyone got any interesting ideas for what could be done with a scientific understanding of Essence and its related phenomena? Other than the God-Machine, that is. I'm thinking particularly with reference to the Shadow, simply because it's easier (and less morally dubious) to reproduce effects based on Resonance and spirits than on ghosts and Anchors.<br /> <br /> A thought I had was a possibility for enabling nuclear fusion by entrapping a solar spirit and forcing it - through bans, bindings, deals or other magic - to use its Influences to help the reaction along.<br /> <br /> Another idea - although this is a great deal more advanced and would require an understanding of spirit 'biology' - would be a kind of pseudo-spirit consisting only of the bits that make its Influences work, its Essence tank and whatever it needs to take in Essence from Resonance, along with some method of turning the Influence 'on' and 'off'. I can think of a lot of uses to which such a 'contraption' could be put, depending on the strength and type of its Influence. Even just Influence 1 could be very useful. Imagine something with Influence: Efficiency hooked up to an engine, or Influence: Firefighting used to combat a wildfire.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 03-21-2018, 03:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T14:46:23-07:00","id":1198129,"title":"","content":"Mass produced talens and pseudo-fetishes?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T14:54:26-07:00","id":1198133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198129#post1198129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mass produced talens and pseudo-fetishes?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's an excellent point. I could see a practice of 'employing' spirits as fetishes in exchange for an essence 'salary'. Like 'remember to feed your fetish regularly. Failure to feed it may result in: *long list of potential nasty consequences of a pissed-off spirit*'.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T15:00:02-07:00","id":1198138,"title":"","content":"A technology which extracts Host Shards and transplant them into humans, or one which encodes spirits into silicon talismans and allows to store and send the bound spirits through the digital world counts? If so, I have written a conspiracy for each of those :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T15:02:23-07:00","id":1198140,"title":"","content":"That's sort of how fetishes work already. But if you feed them too much they can escape.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-21-2018, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T16:23:10-07:00","id":1198158,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198140#post1198140\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's sort of how fetishes work already. But if you feed them too much they can escape.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Pay attention to the manual, folks - generate the listed Resonance only. No more, no less.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-21T22:48:47-07:00","id":1198252,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198158#post1198158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> &amp;quot;Pay attention to the manual, folks - generate the listed Resonance only. No more, no less.&amp;quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That sounds like it'd be the basis for a really good dystopia.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T06:45:16-07:00","id":1198313,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Well, to look at some things Essence science could do, let\u2019s see what\u2019s already (theoretically) possible for humans to do with Essence and Resonance:<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">For one, Essence of a particular Resonance can be used to lure spirits to particular locations. If you dump a bunch of anger essence somewhere (either through generating anger, or using some physical way to move it in the Shadow) you can probably bring proper Spirits to a certain location just to feed, with all the attendant consequences. Alternatively, starving spirits in that locale may well be turned to Magath in the same way.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Likewise, it is possible, through gathering large amounts of Essence in one place and th\\en preventing spirits from feeding (possibly through Warding), to create new Loci. Conversely, you could destroy Loci by destroying focal points and letting spirits eat up the remaining Essence.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Finally, Essence can be a bargaining tool to Spirits, and there\u2019s no real reason why humans cannot barter with Spirits for particular actions.<br /> <br /> With all that in mind, a less-technical way to scientifically harness Essence might well look a lot like the way humans domesticated animals: Humanity is a naturally rich source of Essence. If it can in any sense control the storage and flow of said Essence, it suddenly becomes an important source of power for any spirit willing to help them.</span></span></span></span></span></span><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23896,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","user":"Mirthless","date":".  Ugh why was it all bold? 03-22-2018, 09:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","name":"Mirthless","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T06:57:05-07:00","id":1198316,"title":"","content":"So, an essential technology would be some reliable way to take up, contain and move Essence - an Essence 'bucket' or 'tank' if you will. Preferably one with some ability to repel spirits or otherwise prevent them stealing the Essence. Like a scarecrow for crows, except for spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T07:33:54-07:00","id":1198320,"title":"","content":"Or even something which is to Essence as irrigation systems are to water.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T08:00:06-07:00","id":1198323,"title":"","content":"Yeah, those would be very useful technologies for inventing something akin to spiritual cattle herding. Not strictly necessary, if you can get people to feel certain emotions in the right spot, but a definite efficiency multiplier very much akin to the difference between being spiritual hunter/gatherers and spiritual agriculture...essentiaculture?<br /> <br /> And for scarecrows...well, Warding exists and is provably effective. Of course, the only beings we know that can perform Warding are, specifically, humans who are not Soulless. So...I wonder what the essential component of a spirit scarecrow might be?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","name":"Mirthless","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T08:16:56-07:00","id":1198326,"title":"","content":"Well, you could guard against specific types of spirit via their Bans and Banes, but those aren't necessarily easy to leverage in that fashion and might be very difficult or expensive to get a hold of if they can be used as such. An Open Rite of some kind could be useful, but likely wouldn't do much against anything past Rank 2 or so, given the general level of power, and might again be tricky to use widely due to monetary, difficulty or moral problems. I can't really remember how Warding works, though, and I don't have a copy of the core on me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T08:31:13-07:00","id":1198329,"title":"","content":"Warding works by a Presence+Occult roll penalized by the entity's rank and further modified by your Integrity score. It requires knowledge of an entity's bane to work properly and, when succesful, makes &quot;moving into the area&quot; into a ban for the entity. It's entirely possible for a mundane human to ward away even a Rank 5 spirit if you know the appropriate Bane.<br /> <br /> (Binding is basically a warding but pulled in reverse).<br /> <br /> Presumably, some Essence-tech Ward-O-Matic 3000 could do just as well if it knew the Bane...<br /> <br /> (...and here I'm suddenly imagining some sort of database with Banes for common spirits and machine learning that allows it to impute likely banes for those that are more rare...)<br /> <br /> ...provided it has access to the Bane material and also somehow has a human soul, which has a bunch of horrifying implications.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23896-mirthless","name":"Mirthless","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"54"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T08:52:04-07:00","id":1198334,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mirthless</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198329#post1198329\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...provided it has access to the Bane material and also somehow has a human soul, which has a bunch of horrifying implications.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it's not like there is a black market for that sort of thing...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T09:08:35-07:00","id":1198338,"title":"","content":"OK, that simplifies the issue. I don't think you could really make a 'warding machine' - not without, as you say, some really horrifying implications - but it couldn't be <i>too</i> hard to train people in Warding as a profession. The database of Banes, though, would definitely be workable, and would make a great deal of sense. Research might even be able to find some deeper, underlying pattern to which spirits have what Banes.<br /> <br /> I can see two issues with this whole 'essentiaculture' idea, though. The first is that many spirits are of rather higher intelligence than your standard farm animal, and although their single-mindedness offsets that somewhat, they'd be rather harder to 'herd', especially the ones of Rank 3+. You'd probably have to do something closer to employment with the higher-order spirits, and you'd need to deal with spirit courts. Secondly, other than removing malign spiritual influence, what's the point of essentiaculture? I mean, if you're providing spirits with Essence, what's their motivation to have the influence you want? Unless you withhold it until they do what you want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T09:18:20-07:00","id":1198340,"title":"","content":"Plus these very acts would just start creating different spirits. Slavery, imprisonment, warding.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T09:25:37-07:00","id":1198342,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198340#post1198340\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Plus these very acts would just start creating different spirits. Slavery, imprisonment, warding.</div> </div> </div> </div>Those could be persuaded to help, though, if you fed them well enough. You'd need to be careful about it, but it could be done.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T09:44:42-07:00","id":1198344,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198342#post1198342\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those could be persuaded to help, though, if you fed them well enough. You'd need to be careful about it, but it could be done.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think it works like that.<br /> <br /> Spirits seem to want more, so eventually these captive or created spirits would eat each other, then get powerful, and go off and find a better feeding ground. Or worse, just reach across and start taking control of things on its own.<br /> <br /> Even if they didn't, all you have is a spirit. And there's spirits all over, not causing much beneficial for the world. Capturing one or three isn't going to change things. If you wanted to make a deal with a spirit, you don't need to go through such convoluted methods, but you would want to keep in mind that it's going to be a two-way street until one side decide it wants more. For instance the idea of a solar spirit 'helping' nuclear fusion go along. You already have nuclear fusion. There's a nuclear spirit there that is already invested in keeping nuclear fusion going. You wouldn't need to trap an external spirit, and having it 'help' wouldn't seem to do much more than Strengthen, which might make a power plant produce a bit more but likely would dim out once you get into the electrical grid.<br /> <br /> Part of the trick with using this as technology is computers. A computer can run a specifically-Resonant program faster, more precisely, and efficiently than a human can. This is how I think the God-Machine originated, incidentally. Once you get these 'artificial' but focused spirits crafted, you lure them into claiming or possession, and keep working on increasingly-more refined programs to make yourself more powerful, but also more unassailable. The bigger, more aware you are, the more vulnerable you are, and thus the more protective measures you need in place, and the more power you need to supply them. You don't want spirits anymore, cause spirits are hungry and might attempt to take you out. So you find a way to empower your waste, and so you have Angels.<br /> <br /> But that's beyond mortal capability, we're unable to focus and specify our minds in such a way. The traditional methods of dealing with spirits are worship and offerings in exchange for services. But that's much less 'technologized' except from the viewpoint that any applied knowledge is technology. You seem to want more spirit-guns and factories. For this, you might look at something like Task Force Valkyrie. An alternative would be powerful things like the omphalos stones, which might operate as power sources beyond 'just' Essence. Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1176040-five-pounds-of-meat?p=1181190#post1181190\">Hast/'Ur'</a> for instance..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-22-2018, 12:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T11:20:29-07:00","id":1198365,"title":"","content":"All of that talk reminds me of a certain conspiracy &quot;spirit slayer&quot; I wanted to write for some time, which have a very specific form of &quot;essence technology&quot;. Well, time to get top work :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T12:47:01-07:00","id":1198380,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198344#post1198344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't think it works like that.<br /> <br /> Spirits seem to want more, so eventually these captive or created spirits would eat each other, then get powerful, and go off and find a better feeding ground. Or worse, just reach across and start taking control of things on its own.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which is where judicious use of good Essence-pay, regulation, warding and Bans and Banes would come in.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198344#post1198344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if they didn't, all you have is a spirit. And there's spirits all over, not causing much beneficial for the world. Capturing one or three isn't going to change things. If you wanted to make a deal with a spirit, you don't need to go through such convoluted methods, but you would want to keep in mind that it's going to be a two-way street until one side decide it wants more. For instance the idea of a solar spirit 'helping' nuclear fusion go along. You already have nuclear fusion. There's a nuclear spirit there that is already invested in keeping nuclear fusion going. You wouldn't need to trap an external spirit, and having it 'help' wouldn't seem to do much more than Strengthen, which might make a power plant produce a bit more but likely would dim out once you get into the electrical grid.</div> </div> </div> </div>You raise a good point re: the existence of the fusion spirit. However, you could use the solar spirit to ''ignite' the fusion spirit in the first place, then make use of its desire to continue, you know, existing to keep the fusion reaction going even when it ought not to.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198344#post1198344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Part of the trick with using this as technology is computers. A computer can run a specifically-Resonant program faster, more precisely, and efficiently than a human can. This is how I think the God-Machine originated, incidentally. Once you get these 'artificial' but focused spirits crafted, you lure them into claiming or possession, and keep working on increasingly-more refined programs to make yourself more powerful, but also more unassailable. The bigger, more aware you are, the more vulnerable you are, and thus the more protective measures you need in place, and the more power you need to supply them. You don't want spirits anymore, cause spirits are hungry and might attempt to take you out. So you find a way to empower your waste, and so you have Angels.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's an interesting idea, but if that were true I suspect we'd see more Machine involvement in the Shadow, whereas it's called out as being primarily present in the physical world and having only limited presence in the Shadow. The point you're making with regards to spirit-tech, though, is valid. It's the Shadow's tendency to create feedback loops of Resonance. What we really need is some method of making it a negative feedback loop, but balanced in such a way that it benefits us.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198344#post1198344\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The traditional methods of dealing with spirits are worship and offerings in exchange for services. But that's much less 'technologized' except from the viewpoint that any applied knowledge is technology. You seem to want more spirit-guns and factories. For this, you might look at something like Task Force Valkyrie. An alternative would be powerful things like the omphalos stones, which might operate as power sources beyond 'just' Essence. Check out <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1176040-five-pounds-of-meat?p=1181190#post1181190\">Hast/'Ur'</a> for instance..</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, that Hast/'Ur' thing is... horrifying. Interesting, though. I'm not familiar with what an omphalos stone is, however, apart from the big thing in the Astral. And I'm not just looking at ideas for spirit-guns and factories, I'm looking for ways of exploiting the Shadow via application of knowledge of how it works which are possible on a large-scale/industrial level.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T13:00:15-07:00","id":1198385,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198380#post1198380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">However, you could use the solar spirit to ''ignite' the fusion spirit in the first place, then make use of its desire to continue, you know, existing to keep the fusion reaction going even when it ought not to.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure what you mean by this, especially by the 'ignite' the fusion spirit part. If the fusion goes out, there would be no Essence, so the spirit would go dormant or go away.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's an interesting idea, but if that were true I suspect we'd see more Machine involvement in the Shadow, whereas it's called out as being primarily present in the physical world and having only limited presence in the Shadow. The point you're making with regards to spirit-tech, though, is valid. It's the Shadow's tendency to create feedback loops of Resonance. What we really need is some method of making it a negative feedback loop, but balanced in such a way that it benefits us. </div> </div> </div>The God-Machine's #1 priority seems to be self preservation, in which case its first move would be to escape the Shadow, and it's second would be to remove traces of its origin point.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Well, that Hast/'Ur' thing is... horrifying. Interesting, though. I'm not familiar with what an omphalos stone is, however, apart from the big thing in the Astral. </div> </div> </div>To be fair it's the end point of attempted practical usage from spirit-technology, though there's a lot of other things involved (werewolves, souls, hosts). The omphalos stones are parts of the heart-soul of ancient gods. They exude power and Resonance.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And I'm not just looking at ideas for spirit-guns and factories, I'm looking for ways of exploiting the Shadow via application of knowledge of how it works which are possible on a large-scale/industrial level. </div> </div> </div>Have you thought about using the Supernal, instead? It's got more use as a power 'source' rather than the Shadow's 'reflection.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 03-22-2018, 04:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T13:08:54-07:00","id":1198386,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198385#post1198385\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm not sure what you mean by this, especially by the 'ignite' the fusion spirit part. If the fusion goes out, there would be no Essence, so the spirit would go dormant or go away.</div> </div> </div> </div>What I mean is that you use the solar spirit to help the reactor start up in the first place, which starts the gathering of the essence of the spirit of the reactor as a 'functional fusion reactor' as opposed to that of an 'experimental fusion reactor', meaning that you have more useful Influence. Then that spirit, so as to keep itself from going dormant, uses its influence to bolster the reaction. Voila: functional fusion reaction. In the ory. practise would likely be messy, but that's the theory.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> The God-Machine's #1 priority seems to be self preservation, in which case its first move would be to escape the Shadow, and it's second would be to remove traces of its origin point. </div> </div> </div>Point, but why would It not just make use of <i>both</i> worlds equally? It's a powerful entity; the vast majority of spirits couldn't stand up to It and Its servants. It could have access to vast amounts of Essence from the Shadow for 'free', but instead it uses physical Infrastructure, often requiring weird and exotic fuel sources. I could see it doing that if there were something in the Shadow which scared it enough to drive it out, but by the modern times I can't see why it wouldn't re-conquer the Shadow.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> They're parts of the heart-soul of ancient gods. They exude power and Resonance. </div> </div> </div>That sounds useful, rare and dangerous to possess. Cool, but not really industrializable.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T13:15:02-07:00","id":1198390,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198386#post1198386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I mean is that you use the solar spirit to help the reactor start up in the first place, which starts the gathering of the essence of the spirit of the reactor as a 'functional fusion reactor' as opposed to that of an 'experimental fusion reactor', meaning that you have more useful Influence. Then that spirit, so as to keep itself from going dormant, uses its influence to bolster the reaction. Voila: functional fusion reaction. In the ory. practise would likely be messy, but that's the theory.</div> </div> </div> </div>So in mechanical terms you get a Rank 4 Helion to use Create to start a controlled nuclear reaction. Then the spirits created from that keep the nuclear reaction going?<br /> <br /> I think you would have a problem between the steps. I don't believe the usage of a power would create a powerful enough spirit to sustain something like that, or would create enough Essence to create spirits that would do it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Point, but why would It not just make use of <i>both</i> worlds equally? It's a powerful entity; the vast majority of spirits couldn't stand up to It and Its servants. It could have access to vast amounts of Essence from the Shadow for 'free', but instead it uses physical Infrastructure, often requiring weird and exotic fuel sources. I could see it doing that if there were something in the Shadow which scared it enough to drive it out, but by the modern times I can't see why it wouldn't re-conquer the Shadow. </div> </div> </div>It has Angels and Infrastructure in the Shadow. They're just not a big focus of the game. I didn't say anything about conquering the Shadow, either, that would be silly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That sounds useful, rare and dangerous to possess. Cool, but not really industrializable. </div> </div> </div>It's basically an unending (or at least very long-lasting) power source.<br /> <br /> Spirits are inefficient to begin with, they lose Essence just existing and staying active even in the Shadow.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T18:08:15-07:00","id":1198472,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198390#post1198390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Spirits are inefficient to begin with, they lose Essence just existing and staying active even in the Shadow.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u2026Hey, remember what type of spiritual entity <i>doesn't</i> lose Essence in the Shadow and has a dramatically larger capacity for storing it in the first place?<br /> <br /> What could go wrong?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-22T18:17:50-07:00","id":1198477,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology#post1198059\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, this is mostly a thought exercise, but has anyone got any interesting ideas for what could be done with a scientific understanding of Essence and its related phenomena? Other than the God-Machine, that is. I'm thinking particularly with reference to the Shadow, simply because it's easier (and less morally dubious) to reproduce effects based on Resonance and spirits than on ghosts and Anchors.<br /> <br /> A thought I had was a possibility for enabling nuclear fusion by entrapping a solar spirit and forcing it - through bans, bindings, deals or other magic - to use its Influences to help the reaction along.<br /> <br /> Another idea - although this is a great deal more advanced and would require an understanding of spirit 'biology' - would be a kind of pseudo-spirit consisting only of the bits that make its Influences work, its Essence tank and whatever it needs to take in Essence from Resonance, along with some method of turning the Influence 'on' and 'off'. I can think of a lot of uses to which such a 'contraption' could be put, depending on the strength and type of its Influence. Even just Influence 1 could be very useful. Imagine something with Influence: Efficiency hooked up to an engine, or Influence: Firefighting used to combat a wildfire.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> This would actually be pretty cool idea say a Cabal of Mages use their magical secrets to produce ample (read nigh inexhaustible) amounts of normal conventional energy! With such they could power their own I don't know city or island in secret or produce energy to sell to people, especially if they can hide the secret of their tech. Same idea if you use say a Lodge of Werewolves doing this. With Werewolves and Kinfolk working as Engineers. Or well why not a handful of mages working with a Lodge to advance science?<br /> <br /> Cool Beans!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T00:39:41-07:00","id":1198576,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198472#post1198472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">\u2026Hey, remember what type of spiritual entity <i>doesn't</i> lose Essence in the Shadow and has a dramatically larger capacity for storing it in the first place?<br /> <br /> What could go wrong?</div> </div> </div> </div>Heh. Well, quite apart from the logistical, moral and RAEG issues (it's difficult to predict who'll become a werewolf and they are, you know, <i>people</i>) I'm sure it would go <i>fine</i>. Plus, the adaptability and variety of their Gifts would make them more broadly useful than spirits.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198477#post1198477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This would actually be pretty cool idea say a Cabal of Mages use their magical secrets to produce ample (read nigh inexhaustible) amounts of normal conventional energy! With such they could power their own I don't know city or island in secret or produce energy to sell to people, especially if they can hide the secret of their tech. Same idea if you use say a Lodge of Werewolves doing this. With Werewolves and Kinfolk working as Engineers. Or well why not a handful of mages working with a Lodge to advance science?<br /> <br /> Cool Beans!</div> </div> </div> </div>It would certainly be an interesting basis for a Thyrsus/Free Council Legacy, although reliance on Supernal magic would make the scheme unindustrializable due to Paradox and the relative rarity of mages. It would work for a Lodge as well, although Mage/Werewolf group might have issues. For one, do Wolf-Blooded worsen Paradox? Also, the nature of Supernal magic makes it very difficult to use 'scientifically', because it warps reality, and even if you only use it to help you observe something, you never know if what you're observing would be like that if you hand't used the magic there. It's a bit of an uncertainty principle-type deal. Magic is fine for observing things for yourself, but trying to apply the scientific method using supernal magic is tricky.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T00:50:09-07:00","id":1198577,"title":"","content":"<br /> Couldn't you keep the paradoxy stuff in private enclosed rooms. And bottle up the energy in you paradox free Magic lab zone, like massive batteries or some such. Most of umpfh will come from Paradox Free Spirit powers of the Helion or Fire or Fusion spirit, you just need a way to translate it into the physical world. I don't know maybe something along the lines of Powercables that can go into the Shadow? Build something like an Electromagnetic Damn or something around the spirit, using the heat to churn turbines? I don't know. :P<br /> <br /> Hell I was all for Mages just using magic to increase their mental faculties so they could just do normal science and engineering really well. Maybe some Fate and Time magics to save time with shortcuts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T01:05:39-07:00","id":1198581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198320#post1198320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Or even something which is to Essence as irrigation systems are to water.</div> </div> </div> </div>Leyline such as those from Mage are such things, because though they are not Essence flows themselves (which are a thing) they act as lines of Resonance which flavor Essence that cross their paths.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T01:11:18-07:00","id":1198582,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198576#post1198576\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Heh. Well, quite apart from the logistical, moral and RAEG issues (it's difficult to predict who'll become a werewolf and they are, you know, <i>people</i>) I'm sure it would go <i>fine</i>. Plus, the adaptability and variety of their Gifts would make them more broadly useful than spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>And here I thought they talked about the Idigam (meaning, the <i>true</i> natives of the Shadow)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T01:36:25-07:00","id":1198583,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pale_Crusader</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198581#post1198581\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Leyline such as those from Mage are such things, because though they are not Essence flows themselves (which are a thing) they act as lines of Resonance which flavor Essence that cross their paths.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unfortunately, that doesn't really help us move Essence from one place to another, although they could certainly be useful for 'converting' Essence from one type to another. What decides what kind of Resonance a ley line produces?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198582#post1198582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And here I thought they talked about the Idigam (meaning, the <i>true</i> natives of the Shadow)</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar111_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"111\" data-vbnamecard=\"111\">Satchel</a> might have been talking about the Idigam, but I thought they lost Essence just like spirits. If they don't they might be more useful, but I wouldn't want to touch anything Idigam-ey with a ten-foot pole. Although, I guess, it is theoretically possible for an idigam to Coalesce around some concept that is conducive to humans, although even that would be dangerous, given the extremity to which such a being might take such a concept and its alien mentality. That said, if their Essence-shaping powers could be reverse-engineered somehow and replicated, that would be immeasurably useful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 03-23-2018, 04:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T01:52:25-07:00","id":1198587,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198583#post1198583\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar111_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"111\" data-vbnamecard=\"111\">Satchel</a> might have been talking about the Idigam, but I thought they lost Essence just like spirits. If they don't they might be more useful, but I wouldn't want to touch anything Idigam-ey with a ten-foot pole. Although, I guess, it is theoretically possible for an idigam to Coalesce around some concept that is conducive to humans, although even that would be dangerous, given the extremity to which such a being might take such a concept and its alien mentality. That said, if their Essence-shaping powers could be reverse-engineered somehow and replicated, that would be immeasurably useful.</div> </div> </div> </div>just for the record-<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong> W:tF 2e Core</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Idigam possess deep wells of spiritual power. An idigam\u2019s<br /> <i><b>Essence Pool is double</b></i> what it would normally be for a spirit<br /> of its Rank.<i><b> Idigam do not lose Essence daily in the Shadow</b></i>,<br /> although in the world of Flesh, Formless bleed Essence at<br /> twice the usual rate.</div> </div> </div> </div>and hence the &quot;what could go wrong?&quot; thing. The answer is &quot;EVERYTHING&quot;. And hey, what is a mad Essence science if it does not involve one of the Formless? :P","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T02:02:31-07:00","id":1198590,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198587#post1198587\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> just for the record-<br /> <br /> <br /> and hence the &quot;what could go wrong?&quot; thing. The answer is &quot;EVERYTHING&quot;. And hey, what is a mad Essence science if it does not involve one of the Formless? :P</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, we are kinda going for non-mad Essence science, but there's always a place for a situation where a horrific eldritch being is 'harnessed' for energy. I'm picturing Ansar-Zalag (the Heavenly Fire) used as a living fusion reaction.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Not, I might add, that I think this is in any way a good idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":10397,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","user":"ajf115","date":". 03-23-2018, 01:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T02:03:07-07:00","id":1198591,"title":"","content":"Speaking of industrialied spirit magic - if we do bring Supernal magic into the mix, Stealing Fire would help a lot in at least trying contain its fallout. Turn top-class scientists (temporarily) to Sleepwalkers, so that you can have them analyze stuff without going mad!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T02:09:34-07:00","id":1198592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>21C Hermit</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198591#post1198591\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Speaking of industrialied spirit magic - if we do bring Supernal magic into the mix, Stealing Fire would help a lot in at least trying contain its fallout. Turn top-class scientists (temporarily) to Sleepwalkers, so that you can have them analyze stuff without going mad!</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, less mad. And IIRC you'd need to keep recasting Stealing Fire on them or it would lapse with very-not-fun consequences - the spell only holds Quiescence at bay, rather than countering it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T02:25:17-07:00","id":1198594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198592#post1198592\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, less mad. And IIRC you'd need to keep recasting Stealing Fire on them or it would lapse with very-not-fun consequences - the spell only holds Quiescence at bay, rather than countering it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Casting at indefinite Duration would help. Somewhat.<br /> <br /> Well, okay, it still can go horribly wrong, but magic\u2019s been always risky in the CofD. <br /> <br /> Speaking of which, I imagine a lot of Wolf-Blooded involvement in ephemeralurgy, like in that previous posted example of Hast/\u2018Ur\u2019.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T03:42:53-07:00","id":1198603,"title":"","content":"Does Essence itself do anything to objects that contain it? Aether does, so Essence side-effects might be worthwhile.<br /> <br /> Other than that, Fetishes (Mage version, rather than Werewolf version, usually) could be useful for things not possible or inefficient to accomplish normally. Omen Trance for forecasting and predictive analysis. Heal (1E, but updating it is easy) for emergency medical treatment. Aggressive Meme for psy-ops.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T05:56:25-07:00","id":1198620,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198603#post1198603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Does Essence itself do anything to objects that contain it? Aether does, so Essence side-effects might be worthwhile.</div> </div> </div> </div>Are there objects that just contain Essence? I thought it had to be either a Talen or a Fetish. If there are, that would help with the whole 'moving Essence around' thing, even besides any possible side effects.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198603#post1198603\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Other than that, Fetishes (Mage version, rather than Werewolf version, usually) could be useful for things not possible or inefficient to accomplish normally. Omen Trance for forecasting and predictive analysis. Heal (1E, but updating it is easy) for emergency medical treatment. Aggressive Meme for psy-ops.</div> </div> </div> </div>I can see that. Makes sense to me.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T08:18:57-07:00","id":1198667,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198590#post1198590\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, we are kinda going for non-mad Essence science, but there's always a place for a situation where a horrific eldritch being is 'harnessed' for energy. I'm picturing Ansar-Zalag (the Heavenly Fire) used as a living fusion reaction.</div> </div> </div> </div>Part of the problem is that Shadow things are always going to be inefficient to work with. If you're in the Shadow, you can't get anything, because everything's ephemeral. If you bring them into the physical world, they're going to be losing Essence at great amounts.<br /> <br /> Something like Ansar-Zalag is especially dangerous. It has a bane that's easy to use, and seems safe. Ansar-Zalag cannot physically harm people carrying meteoric iron. So you have people with meteoric iron on them, have them throw a couple chains on him and douse him with water to push the turbines and so forth. Except one guy has started stealing all the meteoric iron and replacing it with regular iron because Ansar-Zalag can still mentally control people, so now everyone involved thinks that it would be a grand idea to let the power plant go into meltdown and irradiate the entire city (or since this is a nuclear power plant, region). Ansar-Zalag likes this, because he's been losing Essence every hour because he didn't just have everyone killed in the first place, and if he got too low he might have to just discorporate, slip back into the Shadow and become something else.<br /> <br /> The problem with using the Shadow like this is that it's not good for sustained output of power. It's aptly named, as it is like industrializing shadows or reflections.<br /> <br /> That said, a more proven method to work, though it's not guaranteed, is the simple act of worship or sacrifice in exchange for benefits. Like drowning someone in the river every year to guarantee that the river stays pure of contaminants. Or burying someone alive in the field as sacrifice to 'He Who Walks Behind the Rows' in order to get a good harvest season.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T08:44:32-07:00","id":1198680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198667#post1198667\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Part of the problem is that Shadow things are always going to be inefficient to work with. If you're in the Shadow, you can't get anything, because everything's ephemeral. If you bring them into the physical world, they're going to be losing Essence at great amounts.<br /> <br /> Something like Ansar-Zalag is especially dangerous. It has a bane that's easy to use, and seems safe. Ansar-Zalag cannot physically harm people carrying meteoric iron. So you have people with meteoric iron on them, have them throw a couple chains on him and douse him with water to push the turbines and so forth. Except one guy has started stealing all the meteoric iron and replacing it with regular iron because Ansar-Zalag can still mentally control people, so now everyone involved thinks that it would be a grand idea to let the power plant go into meltdown and irradiate the entire city (or since this is a nuclear power plant, region). Ansar-Zalag likes this, because he's been losing Essence every hour because he didn't just have everyone killed in the first place, and if he got too low he might have to just discorporate, slip back into the Shadow and become something else.<br /> <br /> The problem with using the Shadow like this is that it's not good for sustained output of power. It's aptly named, as it is like industrializing shadows or reflections.<br /> <br /> That said, a more proven method to work, though it's not guaranteed, is the simple act of worship or sacrifice in exchange for benefits. Like drowning someone in the river every year to guarantee that the river stays pure of contaminants. Or burying someone alive in the field as sacrifice to 'He Who Walks Behind the Rows' in order to get a good harvest season.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> 's point regarding fetishes comes to mind - they're rather more reliable than free spirits.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T08:49:36-07:00","id":1198681,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198680#post1198680\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar7212_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"7212\" data-vbnamecard=\"7212\">Vent0</a> 's point regarding fetishes comes to mind - they're rather more reliable than free spirits.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because they aren't <b>free</b>, being trapped as a power source in the Fetish.<br /> <br /> I actually had an idea for using this concept for a Werewolf-specific Infinite Macabre shard. Advanced technology was possible via Essence and Spirit manipulating tech, and FTL through exploiting the &quot;vague&quot; spatial relationship the Shadow has to material space (though I was considering using the less-defined Gauntlet instead as a hyperspace analog). Werewolf, of course, Hunt and clean up the messes caused by abuse of this tech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T10:18:34-07:00","id":1198735,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vent0</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198681#post1198681\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because they aren't <b>free</b>, being trapped as a power source in the Fetish.<br /> <br /> I actually had an idea for using this concept for a Werewolf-specific Infinite Macabre shard. Advanced technology was possible via Essence and Spirit manipulating tech, and FTL through exploiting the &quot;vague&quot; spatial relationship the Shadow has to material space (though I was considering using the less-defined Gauntlet instead as a hyperspace analog). Werewolf, of course, Hunt and clean up the messes caused by abuse of this tech.</div> </div> </div> </div>Exactly. Everything is easier when your slaves can't be annoying by not doing what you want.<br /> <br /> That would be a cool shard. The one thing I'd say is that it might be better to restrict it to the solar system, as in <i>Eclipse Phase</i>, just so it doesn't get too space operatic and the setting doesn't become too sprawling. Also, would the poor mortals understand what they're dealing with or not?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T11:06:14-07:00","id":1198762,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198735#post1198735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly. Everything is easier when your slaves can't be annoying by not doing what you want.<br /> <br /> That would be a cool shard. The one thing I'd say is that it might be better to restrict it to the solar system, as in <i>Eclipse Phase</i>, just so it doesn't get too space operatic and the setting doesn't become too sprawling. Also, would the poor mortals understand what they're dealing with or not?</div> </div> </div> </div>[Off-topic, but] It depends on how much they need to or want to know - how much does the average person understand about electricity, logic gates, etc. that make up modern technology? Is it a programmed search engine, or data Spirits, or a combination of both? The average person just needs to know enough to use the tech. The exact nature of Spirits is probably advanced knowledge, and the question of whether they are sentient or merely complex processes is a subject for philosophers (and ethics investigations).<br /> <br /> Yeah, I was wondering what to do with the First Change and everything if Earth's Moon isn't even close anymore. Solar System is probably fine - that space is still vast enough, after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malkydel: &quot;And the Machine dictated; let there be adequate illumination.&quot;<br /> Yossarian: &quot;And lo, it was optimal.&quot;","edited":{"userid":7212,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","user":"Vent0","date":". 03-23-2018, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7212-vent0","name":"Vent0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7212_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5184"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-23T12:07:45-07:00","id":1198790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ajf115</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1198735#post1198735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly. Everything is easier when your slaves can't be annoying by not doing what you want.</div> </div> </div> </div>Part of the problem with fetishes is that they can only be used by certain magic users, namely Mages and Werewolves, and the results vary between them.<br /> <br /> The other part is, again, once you put enough Essence into a fetish, the spirit can escape.<br /> <br /> So they're not really slaves so much as prisoners in a rickety cage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T06:06:38-07:00","id":1199014,"title":"","content":"I see essence tech and I think Exalted. I take it their way of Essence tech will not work in CoD?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/722-walksforever","name":"Walksforever","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar722_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"213"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T07:06:21-07:00","id":1199035,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Walksforever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1199014#post1199014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see essence tech and I think Exalted. I take it their way of Essence tech will not work in CoD?</div> </div> </div> </div>Closest thing seems to be Sekhem-based sorcery and crafting, which has way too many side effects to harness safely. The only civilization confirmed to have done so was literally run by necromantic demigods.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-24T08:07:41-07:00","id":1199062,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Walksforever</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1198059-essence-based-technology?p=1199014#post1199014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see essence tech and I think Exalted. I take it their way of Essence tech will not work in CoD?</div> </div> </div> </div>CofD's Essence and Exalted's Essence don''t have a massive amount in common with reference to how they work, so no, Exalted principles can't really be applied to it.<br /> <br /> That said, that made me think of Demenses, which made me think of Dragon Lines, which lead to Ley Lines, which lead to me remembering this from Mage:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <ul><li><b>Forces</b>: By precisely aligning a stationary piece of technology that requires heat or electricity to function, the mage may use the Node to power it.</li> <li><b>Life</b>: The mage may harness the Node to bring any plant put there to any point it its life cycle, as long as that point would take a year or less. These changes require a day to complete and a successful Intelligence + Crafts or Intelligence + Survival roll.</li> <li><b>Matter</b>: Unless totally destroyed, stationary, inanimate objects built in alignment with local Resonance heal one point of Structure per day. Their permanent Structure may slowly wear down due to environmental conditions, but at half the usual rate. This process is undetectable by Sleepers.</li> <li><b>Space</b>: Mages who examine the area magically acquire a +2 bonus to tasks that require significant movement through space, including driving, running, and certain athletic feats.</li> <li><b>Time</b>: Mages who study the area with magic benefit from a +2 bonus to Initiative.</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div>The ones for Forces and Life seem particularly useful, even more so if they could be harnessed by a non-mage somehow. I mean, the first one gives you unlimited energy provided that the Node isn't disrupted, albeit on a relatively small scale. The second is basically a farmer's godsend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/<img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=423\" data-tempid=\"temp_423_1523360155059_212\" />\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10397-ajf115","name":"ajf115","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2416"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T12:19:30-07:00","id":1199448,"title":"","content":"Makes me think if you activated a permanent (or just keep renewing the effect) effect you could create a perpetual motion engine of some sort. Or even create a flame that doens't go out and use it as a coalless furnace.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}